# Build context of the root Dockerfile (api / agent / migrate image).
# Allow-list: the image needs only the project metadata, the lockfile and the
# package source. Everything else (secrets, virtualenvs, the web app, demo
# data, git history, tests, docs) stays out of the context.
*
!pyproject.toml
!uv.lock
!README.md
!src/

# Never ship these even if they appear under an allowed path.
**/.env
**/.env.*
**/.venv
**/node_modules
**/data
**/.git
**/__pycache__
**/*.pyc
